        "text": "<thinking> To implement the file poll_transcription.py that polls a transcription job and returns the transcript, I will use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API. This is a concrete external provider that can be identified in the code by the import of the specific client library and the use of the API endpoint. </thinking>\n",
