        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a Python file that submits an audio file for batch transcription using a concrete external provider. The chosen provider for this task is Amazon Transcribe, a popular speech-to-text service. The code will use the Boto3 library to interact with Amazon Transcribe, which is identifiable by the import statement and the use of the 'transcribe' service client. </thinking>\n",
